---
// 拼接式（late fusion）vs 原生多模态（early fusion）：模态在哪个阶段融合
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 380" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="nf2" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L9,5 L0,10 Z" fill="#94a3b8"></path>
      </marker>
      <filter id="nf2-shadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
        <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#0b2a3a" flood-opacity="0.10"></feDropShadow>
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="300" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">模态在哪一层融合：拼接式 vs 原生多模态</text>

      {/* ============ 拼接式（late fusion） ============ */}
      <text x="30" y="60" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b5791f">拼接式（late fusion）：LLM 冻结，视觉在末端“贴入”</text>

      {/* 文本输入 → 直接进 LLM */}
      <rect x="34" y="150" width="74" height="30" rx="7" fill="#eef2f8" stroke="#8fa4c9"></rect>
      <text x="71" y="169" font-size="10" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">文本</text>
      <line x1="108" y1="165" x2="198" y2="165" stroke="#8fa4c9" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>

      {/* 图像 → 编码器 → 桥接（在最后才汇入） */}
      <rect x="34" y="80" width="74" height="30" rx="7" fill="#f0f9fc" stroke="#7ec3d8"></rect>
      <text x="71" y="99" font-size="10" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">图像/视频</text>
      <line x1="108" y1="95" x2="132" y2="95" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>
      <rect x="136" y="80" width="60" height="30" rx="7" fill="#fdf3ec" stroke="#e6a23c"></rect>
      <text x="166" y="93" font-size="9.5" fill="#b5791f" text-anchor="middle">编码器</text>
      <text x="166" y="105" font-size="9.5" fill="#b5791f" text-anchor="middle">+ 桥接</text>
      <line x1="196" y1="95" x2="200" y2="138" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>

      {/* 冻结 LLM */}
      <rect x="200" y="92" width="180" height="116" rx="10" fill="#eef2f8" stroke="#8fa4c9" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,4"></rect>
      <text x="290" y="146" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">冻结的文本 LLM</text>
      <text x="290" y="166" font-size="9.5" fill="#8296b8" text-anchor="middle">纯文本骨干，权重不动</text>
      <text x="290" y="184" font-size="9.5" fill="#b5791f" text-anchor="middle">视觉 token 在入口末端拼入</text>

      {/* 输出 */}
      <line x1="380" y1="150" x2="424" y2="150" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>
      <rect x="428" y="135" width="86" height="30" rx="7" fill="#f4f6f9" stroke="#cbd5e1"></rect>
      <text x="471" y="154" font-size="10" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">文本回答</text>

      <text x="30" y="234" font-size="10" fill="#8a6a3a">复用现成 LLM、成本低；但视觉只在浅层之后才进入，跨模态交互浅。代表：BLIP-2、LLaVA</text>

      {/* ============ 原生多模态（early fusion） ============ */}
      <text x="30" y="272" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50">原生多模态（early fusion）：端到端训练，模态全程混排</text>

      {/* 多模态输入（左） */}
      <rect x="30" y="292" width="78" height="22" rx="6" fill="#8fa4c9"></rect>
      <text x="69" y="307" font-size="9.5" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">文本</text>
      <rect x="30" y="318" width="78" height="22" rx="6" fill="#7ec3d8"></rect>
      <text x="69" y="333" font-size="9.5" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">图像/视频</text>
      <rect x="30" y="344" width="78" height="22" rx="6" fill="#e6a23c"></rect>
      <text x="69" y="359" font-size="9.5" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">语音/音频</text>

      {/* 汇聚进统一骨干（箭头从输入指向骨干） */}
      <line x1="108" y1="303" x2="156" y2="318" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>
      <line x1="108" y1="329" x2="156" y2="329" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>
      <line x1="108" y1="355" x2="156" y2="340" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>

      {/* 统一骨干 */}
      <rect x="160" y="292" width="250" height="66" rx="10" fill="#f0fbf5" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="1.6" filter="url(#nf2-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="285" y="318" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">统一多模态骨干</text>
      <text x="285" y="336" font-size="9.5" fill="#3f8065" text-anchor="middle">所有层都处理 文本 + 视觉 + 语音（早期融合）</text>

      {/* 输出（右，箭头从骨干指向输出，方向正确） */}
      <line x1="410" y1="329" x2="436" y2="329" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nf2)"></line>
      <rect x="440" y="302" width="104" height="18" rx="5" fill="#6d5bd0"></rect>
      <text x="492" y="315" font-size="9" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">文本回答</text>
      <rect x="440" y="324" width="104" height="18" rx="5" fill="#0f9d68"></rect>
      <text x="492" y="337" font-size="9" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">生成图像 / 视频</text>
      <rect x="440" y="346" width="104" height="18" rx="5" fill="#9b8ae0"></rect>
      <text x="492" y="359" font-size="9" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">语音输出</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
